From: Mohamed Ashry <contact@atharapp.download>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 05:45:29 +0400
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] feat(pipeline): attach @file mention content to the agent
 model prompt

For each file mention the loop reads the target through its ToolExecutor,
compresses it with OutputCompressor to MAX_TOOL_OUTPUT_LINES, and model_prompt
appends a block (path, compressed text, "N of M lines shown"). A failed read
becomes a one-line "could not attach" note and never aborts the turn; non-file
mentions keep the attached: line. Reading through the executor lets an enforced
read-before-write guard record the mention as read.
